   "unit_id": "unit-9740b238004d4d3f942e916de506fe35",
   "title": "Project Design",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The user required an offline-only CLI tool `invoiceparse` that never sends invoice data over the network, with no cloud OCR or telemetry.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c5-t000",
       "char_start": 297,
       "char_end": 351
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The assistant proposed a src layout with cli.py, extract.py, parse.py, and models.py, emphasizing a single function contract `extract_document(path) -> RawDocument`, and the user confirmed keeping extract and parse strictly separated to enable backend swapping.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c5-t001",
       "char_start": 160,
       "char_end": 176
      },
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c5-t002",
